Z||000001||Fiero5||11-12-2000||10:33 PM||||Thanks, it is always a great compliment when someone else appreciates the work you put in your car :o)<P>The paint is the stock maroon color. The graphics were designed and created by myself in my Mac, and then cut in vinyl at a local graphics shop. I then applied them on the car over a two day period.<P>Have you been to our web site yet? It has lot's of pics of our Fieros, and some pics of some of the other Fiero friends we have met along the way :o) <A HREF="http://www.kelleyfamilyfieros.homestead.com/index.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.kelleyfamilyfieros.homestead.com/index.html</A> <BR>You can even order any of the graphics you see on our Fieros, including those you see on Fiero5. Just click on the Kelley Fiero graphics button.<BR><P>------------------<BR>                                                                                                                                                                     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/kellygraphicsMred_1.jpg"> ||||reg||1
